  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.23.0 to 10.1.1\n* Removed deprecated code marked for removal in CliInvoke v3\n* Updated DotExtensions version from 10.1.1 to 10.2.0\n* Re-designed Builder implementation classes to be stateful instead of immutable/stateless, reducing memory usage from Fluent Composition method chaining. and potentially improving performance\n* Added methods to ``ProcessConfigurationBuilder`` to allow configuring UserCredential, Arguments, Environment Variables, and Process Resource Policies via their respective builders through IProcessConfigurationBuilder - these methods have a ``Configure`` prefix to distinguish them from other methods\n* Removed ``ProcessConfigurationFactory``\n* Removed some duplicative/overlapping methods from various Builder implementations\n* Renamed ``ProcessConfigurationBuilder``'s ``ConfigureWindowCreation`` method to ``EnableWindowCreation``\n* Updated cancellation code to support using different cancellation policies depending on cancellation reason (e.g. Timeout vs requested Cancellation) \n* Renamed ``RunnerProcessFactory`` to ``RunnerConfigurationFactory``\n* Shortened the namepace for ``RunnerConfigurationFactory`` \n* Updated ``FilePathResolver`` to support updates to ``IFilePathResolver``",
